  "term": "BOT",
  "definition": "BOT refers to a social-platform account treated as an automated or malicious social actor whose activity can threaten the integrity and safety of online networks. In this source, bots are identified by patterns in how they connect and interact with human and bot accounts and by features found in their local online neighborhood.",
